{"3789830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mistwilds", "steam_appid": 3789830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/a40a800f1cd8e81cf34143ef9fd90085.avif?t=1787875076\" width=800 height=215 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/0471c8dad1e2908d8dab645e0db811a5.avif?t=1787875076\" width=607 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mistwilds</strong> is an MMORPG where you explore a vast open world with your friends. Venture into lush grasslands, windswept peaks, and fiery deserts as you uncover rare creatures, conquer dungeons, and forge your legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Massive Open World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through <strong>diverse zones</strong>: enchanted forests, sun-scorched deserts, icy peaks, magical plains, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome features <strong>unique wild creatures</strong>, dungeons, loot, and quests.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time PvE &amp; PvP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your team into battle against wild creatures, dungeon bosses, and other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in <strong>open-world arenas</strong>, or group up for <strong>epic dungeon runs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up</strong> with powerful items that enhance your tactical depth.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Exploration</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends and explore together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle <strong>co-op dungeons</strong>, <strong>trade rare items and creatures</strong>, and team up to get <strong>legendary loot</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests, vendors, creatures, and loot</strong> await around every corner.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Customization &amp; Mounts</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your adventurer with <strong>character customization</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>tons of unique gear</strong>, each with  visual flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride <strong>tons of different mounts.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Combat (PvE &amp; PvP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless Open World Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Multiplayer Support (Party, Trade, Dungeons, Chat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Realtime Type-Based Combat System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character &amp; Gear Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount System with Flying &amp; Ground Variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of Quests, Items &amp; Vendors</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789830/extras/0471c8dad1e2908d8dab645e0db811a5.avif?t=1787875076\" width=607 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mistwilds</strong> is an MMORPG where you explore a vast open world with your friends. Venture into lush grasslands, windswept peaks, and fiery deserts as you uncover rare creatures, conquer dungeons, and forge your legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Massive Open World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through <strong>diverse zones</strong>: enchanted forests, sun-scorched deserts, icy peaks, magical plains, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome features <strong>unique wild creatures</strong>, dungeons, loot, and quests.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time PvE &amp; PvP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your team into battle against wild creatures, dungeon bosses, and other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in <strong>open-world arenas</strong>, or group up for <strong>epic dungeon runs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up</strong> with powerful items that enhance your tactical depth.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Exploration</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends and explore together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle <strong>co-op dungeons</strong>, <strong>trade rare items and creatures</strong>, and team up to get <strong>legendary loot</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests, vendors, creatures, and loot</strong> await around every corner.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Customization &amp; Mounts</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your adventurer with <strong>character customization</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>tons of unique gear</strong>, each with  visual flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride <strong>tons of different mounts.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Combat (PvE &amp; PvP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless Open World Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Multiplayer Support (Party, Trade, Dungeons, Chat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Realtime Type-Based Combat Sys